### 1. Registrar usuario (esperado: 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Obtener token JWT (esperado: 200 OK - guarda el token automáticamente)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 3. Probar ruta protegida sin token (esperado: 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/secured

### 4. Probar ruta protegida con el token JWT (esperado: 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/secured
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
